====== ASUS RT-N16 ======
The Asus RT-N16 is a middle class router from 2010 with gigabit ethernet and 802.11n draft. It is based on the Broadcom [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.broadcom.bcm47xx|BCM47xx]] SoC platform.


